---
---

<section class="hero-section" id="inicio">
  <!-- Camada de Fundo Sutil Clínico -->
  <div class="hero-bg-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container text-center hero-content">
    
    <!-- Logo Real Oficial -->
    <div class="logo-wrapper reveal delay-1">
      <img 
        src="/assets/logo.png" 
        alt="Apneia na Prática" 
        width="164" 
        height="75" 
        class="brand-logo"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Headline Principal (H1 Único) -->
    <h1 class="hero-title reveal delay-2">
      Aprenda a reconhecer sinais de possível apneia antes que passem despercebidos na sua consulta.
    </h1>

    <!-- Subheadline -->
    <p class="hero-subtitle reveal delay-2">
      Saiba o que observar, quais perguntas fazer e quando o sono merece uma investigação mais aprofundada. <strong>Treinamento para dentistas por R$ 47,00, com cartilha prática para o uso no consultório.</strong>
    </p>

    <!-- Mockup Real Oficial -->
    <div class="mockup-wrapper reveal delay-3">
      <div class="mockup-ambient-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img 
        src="/assets/mockup.png" 
        alt="Mockup do treinamento Apneia na Prática exibido em notebook, tablet e smartphone" 
        width="580" 
        height="385" 
        class="hero-mockup"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Bloco de CTA -->
    <div class="cta-wrapper reveal delay-4">
      <a href="#oferta" class="btn-primary hero-cta">
        QUERO ACESSAR AGORA
      </a>
      <div class="microcopy-wrapper">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lock-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2" />
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
        </svg>
        <p class="microcopy cta-microcopy">
          Pagamento 100% seguro processado via Hotmart. Seus dados estão protegidos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding-top: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 68px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--bg-page);
  }

  .hero-bg-layer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: url('/assets/hero-bg.jpg') center top / cover no-repeat;
    opacity: 0.6;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 65%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 100%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75) 65%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .logo-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: clamp(14px, 2vw, 22px);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    max-width: 154px;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(12, 38, 88, 0.05));
  }

  .hero-title {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(12px, 1.6vw, 16px);
    color: var(--color-navy-700);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 32px);
    font-size: clamp(15.5px, 1.15vw, 17px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }

  .hero-subtitle strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy-700);
  }

  .mockup-wrapper {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(22px, 3.2vw, 32px);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .mockup-ambient-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 90%;
    height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(24, 181, 200, 0.16) 0%, rgba(33, 120, 159, 0.05) 50%, transparent 80%);
    filter: blur(24px);
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-mockup {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 14px 32px rgba(12, 38, 88, 0.12));
    transition: transform var(--transition-smooth);
  }

  .hero-mockup:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.01);
  }

  .cta-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 350px;
  }

  .microcopy-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 5px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .lock-icon {
    color: var(--color-teal-600);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cta-microcopy {
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .brand-logo {
      max-width: 130px;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
